@node no2 " Requirements"

You need an Amiga 500/1000/2000/3000 (The Sysops with an A4ooo or A12oo 
should call my BBS to receive an uncompiled Version)
Kickstart 2.0 or higher
Ami Express 2.xx - 3.xx (Registered)
An running RPStart
rexxplsextnd.library
Rexxplslib.library
rexxsyslib.library
rexxsupport.library
in your Libs: but they are included

Thats all...

@endnode
@node no3 " Installation"

First copy all Libs: (If you dont have them allready) into your libs: Dir
Copy the Want.info to your BBS:Commands/bbscmd/
and make shure you run rpstart in your Startup-Sequence.
Then create a Directory called Want in your Doors...
There you copy all Files and Dirs from the Archive Directory 
BBS/Doors/Want/

There must be in all this Files and Dirs...

message                    10016 (Messagebase Tool)
want.Header                  263 (Output header)
want.Aim                   68492 (The Door)
want.cfg                     233 /The COnfig File)

After this jump into the Chat.Cfg File and change the Level...

--------------------Cut here--------------------
BBS:Request/
bbs:Request/want.txt
50
200
253
--------------------Cut here--------------------

Line1= Path to your Request Conference where the Msg's are posted
Line2= Path to the Final Output txt
Line3= Level to make an Valid request
Line4= Level allows to make the Request Message EALL
       Levels below are only ALL Messages
line5= Level allows to remove/edit Requests

Load your Bull.<lvl>.txt(gr) into your editor an display the OutputFile
via an MCI Command like this..
--------------------Cut here--------------------
~
~f ;clear Screen
~SS_BBS:REQUEST/WANT.TXT <- Note the Space after the Mci Command
--------------------Cut here--------------------

@endnode
